0..55 Comment "//! This source tests univalence at signature corollas."
56..59 Comment "//!"
60..136 Comment "//! A translator must be natural along each corolla automorphism. Its tables"
137..213 Comment "//! must cover exactly the shared corollas. Related corollas must have equal"
214..233 Comment "//! element counts."
234..237 Comment "//!"
238..309 Comment "//! The examples accept a natural relabelling. They refuse an unnatural"
310..373 Comment "//! relabelling, mismatched tables and unmatched cardinalities."
374..377 Comment "//!"
378..453 Comment "//! - cites: [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]"
454..500 Comment "//! - cites: [Petrakis-2022-univalent_typoids]"
501..504 Comment "//!"
505..681 Comment "//! [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]: https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129514000565 \"Shulman, Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity\""
682..783 Comment "//! [Petrakis-2022-univalent_typoids]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.06651 \"Petrakis, Univalent Typoids\""
